M-E-105" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-E-105 Manage feature | Aha!</a></p>
<p>Epic:&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/featur=
es/FUM-193" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-193 Manage feature upgrades | Aha!</a></p>
<p>Design: <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Access+Control+-+Man=
aging+Feature+Package+Updates" rel=3D"nofollow">Access Control - Managing F=
eature Package Updates - NBIN - Web Platform and IAM - Confluence (bnc.ca)<=
/a></p>
